 505		$\delta_Q$ is the function of Lemma~\ref{lem:qld-4-10}:
 506		\begin{enumerate}
 507			\item (\textbf{Self-consistency}) On average over uniformly random
 508			$(x, z, \alpha, \beta) \in \F_q^{2m+2}$,
